  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Trjámann. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Trjámann is an Icelandic trick-taking game for 3 players using a 48-card deck (no 2s). Features 4 contract types (Nullo, Grand, Spades, Other) chosen in rotation. The contract chooser exchanges with a 4-card 'Manni' (widow). Each player must play all 4 contracts once over 12 rounds. First to 10+ points wins.",
    objective: 'Reach 10 or more points over 12 rounds by making your trick quota in each contract; each player plays each of the four contracts (Nullo, Grand, Spades, Other) once.',
    gameplay: 'Choose contract: Nullo (avoid tricks, no trump), Grand (win tricks, no trump), Spades (trumps=spades), Other (choose trump). Contracted player: quota 8 tricks (or 4 in Nullo). Others: 4 tricks (or 6 in Nullo). +1/-1 per trick above/below quota. Exchange with Manni optional.',
